# Pinspire API v1 — file uji manual
#
# Cara pakai:
#   VS Code  : install ekstensi "REST Client" (humao.rest-client), lalu klik "Send Request"
#              di atas setiap blok ###.
#   JetBrains: file .http dikenali otomatis (IntelliJ / PhpStorm).
#
# Urutan yang disarankan: jalankan "Login (demo)" dulu supaya {{token}} terisi.

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1
@accept = application/json

### ============================================================
### 1. AUTH
### ============================================================

### Register (ganti email kalau sudah dipakai)
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Accept: {{accept}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Budi Santoso",
  "username": "budi",
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "password_confirmation": "password123",
  "device_name": "rest-client"
}

### Login (demo) — jalankan ini dulu untuk mengambil token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Accept: {{accept}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@pinspire.test",
  "password": "password",
  "device_name": "rest-client"
}

### Token otomatis diambil dari respons login di atas
@token = {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Me (butuh token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Accept: {{accept}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Logout (butuh token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Accept: {{accept}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================================
### 2. PINS (publik, token opsional untuk is_saved)
### ============================================================

### Feed pins
GET {{baseUrl}}/pins?per_page=5&page=1
Accept: {{accept}}

### Feed pins + filter kata kunci
GET {{baseUrl}}/pins?search=dekorasi
Accept: {{accept}}

### Detail pin
GET {{baseUrl}}/pins/1
Accept: {{accept}}

### Detail pin sebagai user login (isi is_saved)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pins/1
Accept: {{accept}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upload pin (multipart) — ganti path file gambar
POST {{baseUrl}}/pins
Accept: {{accept}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----PinspireBoundary

------PinspireBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Sudut Baca Minimalis
------PinspireBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Kursi rotan + lampu hangat.
------PinspireBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="contoh.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./contoh.jpg
------PinspireBoundary--

### Update pin (JSON)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/pins/1
Accept: {{accept}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Judul Baru",
  "description": "Deskripsi baru"
}

### Hapus pin
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/pins/1
# Accept: {{accept}}
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================================
### 3. SEARCH
### ============================================================

### Cari pin (wajib kirim ?q=)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=dekorasi
Accept: {{accept}}


### ============================================================
### 4. BOARDS
### ============================================================

### Daftar board milik saya
GET {{baseUrl}}/boards
Accept: {{accept}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buat board
# @name createBoard
POST {{baseUrl}}/boards
Accept: {{accept}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dekorasi Rumah",
  "description": "Koleksi ide interior.",
  "is_private": false
}

### Id board yang baru dibuat
@boardId = {{createBoard.response.body.$.data.id}}

### Detail board
GET {{baseUrl}}/boards/{{boardId}}
Accept: {{accept}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update board
PUT {{baseUrl}}/boards/{{boardId}}
Accept: {{accept}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rumah & Interior",
  "is_private": true
}

### Pin di dalam board
GET {{baseUrl}}/boards/{{boardId}}/pins
Accept: {{accept}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Hapus board
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/boards/{{boardId}}
# Accept: {{accept}}
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================================
### 5. SAVES (simpan / unsave)
### ============================================================

### Simpan pin ke board
POST {{baseUrl}}/pins/1/save
Accept: {{accept}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "board_id": {{boardId}}
}

### Hapus pin dari board
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/pins/1/save
Accept: {{accept}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "board_id": {{boardId}}
}

### Daftar pin yang saya simpan
GET {{baseUrl}}/saves
Accept: {{accept}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================================
### 6. PROFILE
### ============================================================

### Profil publik (pakai username)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/demo
Accept: {{accept}}

### Pin milik user
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/demo/pins
Accept: {{accept}}

### Board milik user
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/demo/boards
Accept: {{accept}}

### Profil saya
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile
Accept: {{accept}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update profil
PUT {{baseUrl}}/profile
Accept: {{accept}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Demo User Baru",
  "bio": "Bio baru.",
  "website": "https://example.com"
}

### Upload avatar (multipart) — ganti path file
POST {{baseUrl}}/profile/avatar
Accept: {{accept}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----PinspireBoundary

------PinspireBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="avatar"; filename="avatar.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./avatar.jpg
------PinspireBoundary--


### ============================================================
### 7. SETTINGS
### ============================================================

### Lihat settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/settings
Accept: {{accept}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update settings
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings
Accept: {{accept}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "preferences": {
    "email_notifications": false,
    "push_notifications": true
  }
}

### Ganti password (hati-hati: mencabut token lain)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/password
Accept: {{accept}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_password": "password",
  "password": "passwordBaru123",
  "password_confirmation": "passwordBaru123"
}


### ============================================================
### 8. CONTOH ERROR (untuk memastikan format error konsisten)
### ============================================================

### 401 — tanpa token
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Accept: {{accept}}

### 404 — pin tidak ada
GET {{baseUrl}}/pins/999999
Accept: {{accept}}

### 422 — login tanpa field
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Accept: {{accept}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
